 180:Source/render/decoders/webp.c ****      * valid (Lua arrays are 1-based but 0 is writable), and readSymbol reads
 181:Source/render/decoders/webp.c ****      * table[low] with low in [0,255] — so the builder's writes at Lua index
 182:Source/render/decoders/webp.c ****      * base+currentEnd land on the same numeric index the reader uses. The C
